  "<strong>When an appliance fails in La Jolla, our San Diego technicians usually know the failure before they park: condenser coils corroding on the bluff line, a built-in column wedged into a 1920s Village kitchen that was never framed for it, a wine room drifting off setpoint behind a pantry wall, or an outdoor kitchen whose igniters have been eating salt air since the last El Niño. We dispatch across the Village, Bird Rock, the Shores, and the Muirlands daily. $89 residential diagnostic, waived with repair. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal certified (#1346255700410), BBB Accredited.</strong>",
